Package: rode
Version: {version}
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: {architecture}
Maintainer: {maintainer}
Installed-Size: {installed_size}
Depends: {shlibs}, libegl1, libgl1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: openssh-client, git, poppler-utils
Suggests: bubblewrap, python3, python3-venv, procps, gocryptfs, fuse3
Homepage: https://github.com/pbenner/rode
Description: native Rust editor for local projects and SSH workspaces
 RODE provides a file explorer, themed editor, read-only document previews,
 persistent terminals, source control, language tools and project agent chat.
 Its native terminal service supports reattachment on local and remote hosts.
 Optional project sandboxing uses bubblewrap when available.
